The {{Term/Store|Cap of the Hero||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Cap of the Hero is a piece of [[Armor]] which can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the 30th Anniversary 8-Bit Link amiibo. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Treasure Chest]] will appear that has a small chance to contain the Cap of the Hero. It can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

The Cap of the Hero, alongside the [[Tunic of the Hero]] and [[Trousers of the Hero]], comprise the [[Hero Set]] which resembles Link's outfit from the original {{TLoZ}}. When it has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the Master Sword Beam Up [[Set Bonus]] when worn with the full set.

